macOS is now fully supported on Apple Silicon and Intel Macs:

- Unit tests run in CI on macOS 15 and 26 (Apple Silicon) and macOS 15 (Intel).
- Releases include native macOS executables (``peat_macos_arm64`` and ``peat_macos_x86_64``), and ``install_peat.sh`` installs the right one on a Mac.
- The supported macOS versions and the platform's limitations are documented in the system requirements.
